\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Overall System Architecture: Two-Tier Payload-Aware UAV Route Planner. Tier~1 pre-computes the Pareto front once; Tier~2 selects the optimal route for each new payload tag using the stored front.}}{13}{figure.caption.32}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Tier~1 Activity Flow: Multi-Objective A* Pareto Front Construction. The open set is explored in order of estimated total cost until no further non-dominated routes exist.}}{16}{figure.caption.42}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.3}{\ignorespaces Tier~2 Activity Flow: Payload-Driven Pareto Selection. Payload tags are algebraically mapped to weights, which score every Pareto point via a utility function; the argmax is selected as the mission route.}}{21}{figure.caption.60}%
